@When "^submits amendment change and waits for trade update$"
    When click amend using configured risk engine mode for trade stored as 'createdTradeId' from trade details page
    Then component trade change confirmation dialog is visible
    And component trade change confirmation selects reason option 'NON_ECON_CHANGE'
    And click amendment confirm and wait for trade update for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    And component trade change confirmation dialog is hidden

@When "^save amendment and waits for trade update$"
    When trade detail page save trade

@When "^perform amendment for Deal Date on the trade$"
    When opens trade detail for current trade from trade portal
    And store today plus 1 business day as 'dealDate' with format 'yyyy-MM-dd'
    And store today plus 1 business day as 'actualDate' with format 'dd MMM yyyy'
    And page trade detail fills deal date from stored variable 'dealDate'
    And submits amendment change and waits for trade update

@When "^perform amendment for Counterparty for the draft trade$"
    When opens trade detail for current trade from trade portal
    And page trade detail selects counterparty from stored variable 'newCounterpartyName'
    And save amendment and waits for trade update

@When "^perform amendment for Counterparty on the trade$"
    When opens trade detail for current trade from trade portal
    And page trade detail selects counterparty from stored variable 'newCounterpartyName'
    And submits amendment change and waits for trade update

@Then "^Deal Date field shows the amended value in the trade detail page$"
    Then page trade detail deal date field shows value from stored variable 'actualDate'

@Then "^the trade is amended to the updated Counterparty value for approval$"
    Then the trade is pending checker approval in trade details
    And the trade details show the amended Counterparty value

@Then "^the trade is amended to the updated Counterparty value and keeps as Live$"
    Then the trade remains Live in trade details
    And the trade details show the amended Counterparty value

@Then "^the trade is amended to the updated Counterparty value and keeps as Draft"
    Then the trade remains Draft in trade details
    And the trade details show the amended Counterparty value

@Then "^the trade details show the amended Counterparty value$"
    Then page trade detail counterparty field shows value from stored variable 'newCounterpartyName'

@Then "^the trade details show the original Counterparty value$"
    Then page trade detail counterparty field shows value from stored variable 'originalCounterpartyName'

@Then "^the checker cannot amend the trade without maker permission$"
    When opens trade detail for current trade from trade portal
    Then page trade detail fields are disabled for amendment

@Then "^the amendment request is pending checker approval$"
    Then trade status is updated to 'PARV' and event status is updated to 'Amended' in the trade portal page

@Then "^the rejected amendment is reverted to Live$"
    Then trade status is updated to 'LIVE' and event status is updated to 'New' in the trade portal page

@Then "^the amendment is submitted successfully$"
    Then assert toast notification with type 'success' and title as 'Trade updated successfully'
